  "priorExpiration": "2008-12-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 501.02 Violations of Principles of Veterinary Medical Ethics. Conduct which violates the Principles of Veterinary Medical Ethics of the AVMA as revised April 2016 shall constitute unprofessional or dishonorable conduct pursuant to RSA 332-B:14, II(c).\n\nSource. #5024, eff 12-4-90; ss by #6450, INTERIM, eff 2-8-97, EXPIRES: 6-8-97; ss by #6481, eff 3-29-97; ss by #7418, eff 12-21-00, EXPIRED: 12-21-08\n\nNew. #9464-B, eff 4-23-09; ss by #12080, eff 12-30-16",
